To log in to the robot, you can use HDMI or MobaXterm

username: ubuntu                           //all lowercase
password: hiwonder                         //all lowercase

To ensure it works properly, start the camera: sudo systemctl restart start_app_node.service

To open the servo editor: python3 software/ainex_controller/main.py

Warning!!!! 
Work with the PWM values of the servomotors.
